  "pages": [
    {
      "page_id": "p01",
      "text": "The subject of the night work of moths begins with a pattern people can observe. Careful observers record what changes and what stays the same before they try to explain it. A reader can separate the observation from the explanation, then ask whether the cited evidence supports the connection. Recording conditions and repeated results makes the account easier for another person to check.",
      "illustration_brief": "Diagram or scene about animals without printed labels; do not reveal the page's exact wording.",
      "audio_script": "The subject of the night work of moths begins with a pattern people can observe. Careful observers record what changes and what stays the same before they try to explain it. A reader can separate the observation from the explanation, then ask whether the cited evidence supports the connection. Recording conditions and repeated results makes the account easier for another person to check.",
      "timing_segments": []
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p02",
      "text": "A useful model connects several observations. In this case, the central fact is that animals have body parts and behaviors suited to how they live. The model is strongest when it predicts another observation. A reader can separate the observation from the explanation, then ask whether the cited evidence supports the connection. Recording conditions and repeated results makes the account easier for another person to check.",
      "illustration_brief": "Diagram or scene about animals without printed labels; do not reveal the page's exact wording.",
      "audio_script": "A useful model connects several observations. In this case, the central fact is that animals have body parts and behaviors suited to how they live. The model is strongest when it predicts another observation. A reader can separate the observation from the explanation, then ask whether the cited evidence supports the connection. Recording conditions and repeated results makes the account easier for another person to check.",
